Interpretation (docs/v5_spec.md Sec15.3): World A (no signal: AUROC~0.5, Spearman~0, shells indistinguishable) means the problem is upstream of topology learning. World B (Spearman meaningfully positive, top-D enriched for low distance, but [A69]'s exact-edge AUPRC stays at chance) means C_ij encodes locality, not exact adjacency -- reframe future work toward coarse distance/neighborhood learning.
